WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.502 line:92%
-Thank you for having me.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.437
This is my first time ever
on late-night television.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really? Well, we're
very honored to have you.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.608 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you so much.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:11.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am such a huge fan
of this show.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm such a huge fan
of you on the show.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
For anybody
who hasn't caught up,

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
this is a prequel
to "Breaking Bad."

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
Had you -- Were you a fan
of "Breaking Bad" before this?

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I had never seen "Breakin
Bad,"

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I remember,
I was at my father's place

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they were watching
the finale of "Breaking Bad.

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:25.658 line:92%
I walked in on the finale.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.361
-That's what they say -- Jump in
on the last episode, yeah.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.863 line:92%
-Come in only when it gets good.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I remember
seeing that episode

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
and thinking it was
breathtaking.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.601 line:92%
I saw the name Vince Gilligan,

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I made a mental note
to myself.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
And three weeks later,
I had an audition,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.708
and lo and behold, the nam
Vince Gilligan was on it.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.876 line:92%
And if you ever believe in fate,

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
that felt like a moment of fat
right there.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's fantastic.
This show, I will admit,

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I've said this
to other people on the show,

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.150 line:92%
when I first heard the ide

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
that there was going to be
this prequel,

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
it sounded like a bad idea
to me,

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
and yet it is so good
and so riveting.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you play, I feel like,
a character

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.929
that we've seen this path before
in the "Breaking Bad" universe

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
of, you have made
a few bad decisions,

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they just
continue to domino,

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
and things continue
to get worse.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you try to be good,
and a lot --

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.572 line:92%
You do a lot of face actin

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:16.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
of just realizing
how much [bleep] you're in

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, there's --
Thank you, thank you.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.512
I really appreciate it.
A lot of the character --

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of the acting
is non-dialogue based.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:26.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And the character's definitel
walking a razor blade,

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:29.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's just a hell
of a roller coaster ride, man.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're having a blast.
-It is very stressful to watch

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.461 size:78% position:39%
I imagine the scenes
like the clip we saw,

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.495 line:92%
they must be stressful to do

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you have a way to decompres
after shooting?

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.700 size:75% position:38%
-A lot of chocolate.
A lot of ice cream.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of crying
in the shower at night.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
But I'd like to do --

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.906 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I've taken on Muay Thai.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, Muay Thai.
-Mixed martial arts.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
I really enjoy doing that
and hot yoga.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:53.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hot yoga?
-Yeah.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did martial arts
from a young age.

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:58.118
-Oh, very seriously, yes.
-This is a photo you poste

00:01:58.118 --> 00:02:00.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
recently on Instagram. And
there you are back in the day.

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:02.689 size:75% position:38%
-There you go, yeah.
-No, you do not want

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
to run into that kid
in the lunch room, yeah.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.694 line:92%
He is going home with your milk.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:08.261 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's exactly what I was
thinking in that photo.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
who took that photo,

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:15.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I can tell
that I thought I looked badass

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But the person taking it

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
