that I didn't look like --

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's really funny.
I got young kids now.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the funniest thing
when they try to look cool

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:24.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a picture.
And, like, everyone's laughing

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they're like,
"I'm a cool dude."

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"I'm a bad --

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had a sort of
wild upbringing.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.085 line:92%
You grew up all over the place

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:33.753 line:92%
You were born in Quebec, yes

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:34.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:35.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You lived in Africa.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:38.358
-And you sort of missed
American pop culture for a time.

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.427
-Completely. You know, the onl
thing -- We didn't have any TV

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:44.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the only music I knew
was Michael Jackson.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep, worldwide.
-And Prince, yeah.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:48.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
And anything that kind of was,
like, super box office

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.170 line:92%
