00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
So there was like Sylveste
Stallone, Eddie Murphy,

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:56.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that was it.
I only know three actors.

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:57.010 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:02.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I learned to speak English
watching these movies.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:02.749 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's fantastic.

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:04.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A lot of F-bombs
watching Eddie Murphy.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:07.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. You just spoke
in Arnold Schwarzenegger-isms.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.888
-Right, yeah, yeah, yeah.
This is an American accent

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:11.724
-"The first thing I learne
how to say was, 'I'll be back.'"

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:12.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-There you go.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You shoot the show
in New Mexico.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm-hmm.
-Just like "Breaking Bad."

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:17.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have spent some time
in New Mexico.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife's family is from there
-Your -- Yeah.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.734 line:92%
-Yeah, and a lot of snakes

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-This is an issue for you.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
You are not a fan of snakes.
-Very -- No, not at all.

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:28.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
Very serious issue.
I'm terrified of snakes.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:29.809 line:92%
And I was really, really scared.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every time I'd look
at the script,

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:33.112 line:92%
the first thing is, am I dead?

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:36.115
And then the second thing is
do we have to shoot outdoors

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:36.849 size:84% position:42% line:92%
where there are snakes?

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.518
Those were my two biggest fears,
to the point

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:41.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Jennifer Bryan,
the costume designer, and

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:44.023
thought it'd be, you know --
'cause I'm a huge music fan.

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I love Quincy Jones.

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:47.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Quincy Jones,
I saw an interview of him,

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
