a snake earring.

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:05.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're very snake-based.
-Yes.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jennifer Bryan,
the costume designer, and

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
thought it'd be a good ide
to embrace that.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
Embrace the snake.

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:12.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:15.688
One of the things, it's hard
for me to talk to you abou

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.625
because you only saw the las
episode of "Breaking Bad" --

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:20.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your character --
-No, I saw the whole thing

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did see the whole thing
-Yeah, for research,

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:23.363
and I loved it. I loved it
-You would have known this

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:26.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
but obviously, your characte
is not in "Breaking Bad,"

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:28.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a lot of people die
in this show.

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:32.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, do you know yet?
Have they told you your fate

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:34.774
-They haven't told me yet,
but I have to be honest.

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think about it like this
I think, you know,

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:40.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
the character, it's -- For me,
it's a story of redemption

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a character
who did bad choices

00:04:41.648 --> 00:04:43.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
