and get out of the cartel.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:48.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, whatever happens, you know
whether he dies or not,

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:50.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope just,
at least metaphysically

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:51.791 size:88% position:44% line:92%
