00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:54.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it's been a fantastic
journey to watch.

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:56.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're so great
as the character.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
And thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:58.798 line:92%
-Thank you. Thank you very much.

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So honored
that this was your first.

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:02.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
Michael Mando!
